msgctxt "116"
msgid "Was it around here? Gah! This sucks!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid "What's wrong?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "I lost a key somewhere around here. You haven't seen it, have you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "A key? Can't say I have."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Shoot. I live on the third floor here, and I know I had it when I left my "
"place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "So if I dropped it, I must have done so somewhere around this building."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid "Or maybe it was when I was looking out that window..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid "I bet I can find it if I look hard enough."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"Press <Action:Button_R3@Adventure> to enter first-person mode.\r\n"
"Use the "
"<Action:Turn_Camera_Up@Adventure><Action:Turn_Camera_"
"Down@Adventure><Action:Turn_Camera_Left@Adventure><Action:Turn_Camera_"
"Right@Adventure> to look around.\r\n"
"You can get a good look at things in this mode⑬\r\n"
"useful when you're searching for something.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Use first-person mode to find the key that's\r\n"
"been dropped somewhere in the area."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Could you let me know if you see a key around here? Thank you so much for "
"your help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid "Where did I drop that stupid key? I can't get back into my place without it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid "Still haven't found it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "No⑬and I've looked everywhere."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Maybe it's somewhere totally random, like, caught on the roof or something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Or maybe it was when I was looking out that window..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "Where did I drop that stupid key? I can't get back into my place without it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Hey, you were looking for your key, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Yes! Did you find it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Maybe. There's something up on the edge of that hallway on the third floor."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "The third floor? Oh, that could be it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "I'll check and see! Could you just wait here a second?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "That was it, all right! What a dumb place to drop a key!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "It must have fallen when I was looking out the window. Unbelievable!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid "Thank you so much!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "I don't know if you could call this a reward, but here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "You got <Color:255,255,200,255>Ryukyu Locker Key No. 33<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid "A locker key?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"Oh, yes! If you look hard enough, you'll find them all over the place. I "
"don't know why, but people are so careless with these things."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"I found this one earlier and opened the locker, but I had no use for what "
"was in there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "I bet it would come in handy for you, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Anyway, I have to hit the road! Thank you again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"(That sounds... vaguely illegal. But hey, no point looking a gift horse in "
"the mouth. Looks like I have a locker to open.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "You got 2,000 EXP."
msgstr ""

